      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14554/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in minced garlic and garlic powder. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X_Xuw4O_9CmNwvMSfP2KARadpog=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-14554-sirloin-steak-with-garlic-butter-step-03-4x3-4054ef68984146e99e71d7bbb02412f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14554/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season both sides of each steak with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/60-J2Oe3toVBwojign9Nkpaxg8Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-14554-sirloin-steak-with-garlic-butter-step-04-4x3-38412bf288724af4875b51fbf52e3826.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14554/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place steaks on preheated grill and cook 4 to 5 minutes per side. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read 140 degrees F (60 degrees C) for medium doneness.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
